# Inkmoth Nexus: "{T}: Add {C}." It is a land that entered this turn but not a creature, so it taps for mana at once
# (CR 302.6 is about creatures; the card's ruling): on turn 1 its {C} pays for Sol Ring. "{1}: This land becomes a 1/1
# Phyrexian Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying and infect until end of turn. It's still a land." On turn 3 the
# Island pays for it: a Land Artifact Creature - Phyrexian Blinkmoth (CR 205.1b), colorless (the text names no color),
# 1/1 with flying and infect. It attacks, and its combat damage to Bot2 is a poison counter, not lost life
# (CR 702.90b, 120.3b). The effect ends in the cleanup step (CR 514.2): on Bot2's turn 4 it is a plain Land again,
# still tapped from attacking.

[Bot1 Deck]
Inkmoth Nexus
Sol Ring
Island
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Inkmoth Nexus.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Inkmoth Nexus.Activate(Ability: {T})
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Types = Artifact
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Inkmoth Nexus.Activate(Ability: {1})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
